OL,3,AMan charged over Gosport migrant
OL,4,Aprotest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged after a protest
OL,7,Fover migrant arrivals in a Hampshire
OL,8,Ftown.
OL,10,FThe Home Office said 149 migrants were
OL,11,Fpicked up on Sunday in a mid-Channel
OL,12,Frescue operation by the RNLI, alongside
OL,13,Fa French vessel, and were brought
OL,14,Fashore at Gosport.
OL,16,FFlares were set off and there were
OL,17,Fscuffles with police during a stand-off
OL,18,Finvolving about 150 anti-migrant
OL,19,Fdemonstrators.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
