OL,3,AMan charged over Gosport migrant
OL,4,Aprotest
OL,5,
OL,6,FJamie Bennett has been charged with
OL,7,Ffailing to comply with a prohibited
OL,8,Fassembly direction. The 38-year-old, of
OL,9,FThyme Avenue in Whiteley, Fareham, has
OL,10,Fbeen bailed to appear at Portsmouth
OL,11,FMagistrates' Court on 26 November.
